        <summary>
          <para>The recommended stream configuration map for use case preview must contain a subset of efficient, non-stalling configurations that must include both ImageFormat.PRIVATE and ImageFormat.YUV_420_888 output formats. Even if available for the camera device, high speed or input configurations will be absent.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/params/RecommendedStreamConfigurationMap#USECASE_PREVIEW" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.params.RecommendedStreamConfigurationMap.USECASE_PREVIEW</code>.</a></format></para>
